{"id":"u18","kelas":8,"no":9,"judul":"Kesehatan, Surat, dan Email","title":"Health, Letters, and Emails","emoji":"🤒","ringkas":"Keluhan sakit, memberi saran, dan menulis surat atau email","ready":true,"goals":["menyebut bagian tubuh dan keluhan sakit: [[headache]], [[fever]], [[cough]], [[stomachache]]","menanyakan dan menyampaikan keluhan: [[What's the matter?]] dan [[I have a ...]]","memberi saran kesehatan dengan [[should]] dan [[shouldn't]]","memberi semangat: [[Get well soon!]] dan [[Take care!]]","menulis **surat atau email** pendek kepada teman: pembuka, isi, dan penutup"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Kamu atau temanmu pernah sakit, bukan? Di **Unit 9** (unit terakhir Kelas 8) kamu belajar **menyebut keluhan sakit**, **memberi saran**, dan **menulis surat atau email** kepada teman, misalnya untuk menanyakan kabar saat ia sakit."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Bagian tubuh (Parts of the body)","items":[{"en":"head","id":"kepala","ex":""},{"en":"eye","id":"mata","ex":""},{"en":"ear","id":"telinga","ex":""},{"en":"nose","id":"hidung","ex":""},{"en":"mouth","id":"mulut","ex":""},{"en":"tooth / teeth","id":"gigi","ex":""},{"en":"throat","id":"tenggorokan","ex":""},{"en":"neck","id":"leher","ex":""},{"en":"shoulder","id":"bahu","ex":""},{"en":"arm","id":"lengan","ex":""},{"en":"hand","id":"tangan","ex":""},{"en":"stomach","id":"perut","ex":""},{"en":"back","id":"punggung","ex":""},{"en":"leg","id":"kaki (tungkai)","ex":""},{"en":"foot / feet","id":"telapak kaki","ex":""}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Keluhan sakit (Illnesses)","items":[{"en":"headache","id":"sakit kepala","ex":"I have a headache."},{"en":"toothache","id":"sakit gigi","ex":"He has a toothache."},{"en":"stomachache","id":"sakit perut","ex":"She has a stomachache."},{"en":"backache","id":"sakit punggung","ex":"My father has a backache."},{"en":"sore throat","id":"sakit tenggorokan","ex":"I have a sore throat."},{"en":"cough","id":"batuk","ex":"I have a bad cough."},{"en":"cold","id":"pilek / flu ringan","ex":"I have a cold."},{"en":"fever","id":"demam","ex":"He has a high fever."},{"en":"runny nose","id":"hidung berair","ex":"I have a runny nose."},{"en":"sick","id":"sakit","ex":"I'm sick today."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Menanyakan dan menyampaikan keluhan","table":[["Situasi","Ungkapan","Artinya"],["Menanyakan","[[What's the matter?]] / [[What's wrong?]] / [[Are you OK?]]","Ada apa? / Ada masalah apa? / Kamu baik-baik saja?"],["Menjawab","[[I have a headache.]] / [[I feel sick.]]","Aku sakit kepala. / Aku merasa tidak enak badan."],["","[[My stomach hurts.]] / [[My leg hurts.]]","Perutku sakit. / Kakiku sakit."],["Menyampaikan ke orang lain","[[She has a fever.]]","Dia demam."]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Have a ... atau My ... hurts","text":"Dua cara menyebut keluhan: **have a + keluhan** ([[I have a toothache.]]) atau **my + bagian tubuh + hurts** ([[My tooth hurts.]]). Artinya sama."},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Memberi saran kesehatan","text":"Pakai **should / shouldn't** (Unit 8) untuk saran, atau **Why don't you ...?**","table":[["Keluhan","Saran"],["I have a headache.","[[You should take a rest.]]"],["I have a toothache.","[[You should see a dentist.]]"],["I have a cough.","[[You should drink warm water.]]"],["I have a fever.","[[You should go to the doctor.]]"],["I have a stomachache.","[[You shouldn't eat spicy food.]]"],["I feel tired.","[[Why don't you go to bed early?]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"5. Ungkapan penyemangat (Wishes)","items":[{"en":"Get well soon!","id":"Cepat sembuh!","ex":""},{"en":"Take care!","id":"Jaga dirimu!","ex":""},{"en":"I hope you feel better.","id":"Semoga kamu lekas membaik.","ex":""},{"en":"Take a rest.","id":"Istirahatlah.","ex":""},{"en":"Drink a lot of water.","id":"Minumlah banyak air.","ex":""},{"en":"See a doctor.","id":"Periksalah ke dokter.","ex":""}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Di sekolah","lines":[{"who":"Rani","en":"Budi, what's the matter? You look pale.","id":"Budi, ada apa? Wajahmu pucat."},{"who":"Budi","en":"I have a stomachache and I feel sick.","id":"Perutku sakit dan aku merasa tidak enak badan."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Oh no! You should go to the school clinic. And you shouldn't eat spicy food.","id":"Aduh! Sebaiknya kamu ke UKS. Dan sebaiknya jangan makan makanan pedas."},{"who":"Budi","en":"Thanks, Rani. I will.","id":"Terima kasih, Rani. Akan kulakukan."},{"who":"Rani","en":"Get well soon!","id":"Cepat sembuh!"}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"6. Menulis surat atau email pendek","text":"Surat pribadi (personal letter) dan email kepada teman punya bagian yang mirip:","table":[["Bagian","Contoh","Fungsi"],["**Subject** (khusus email)","Get well soon!","judul singkat"],["**Greeting**","Dear Budi,","salam pembuka"],["**Opening**","I heard that you are sick. I hope you feel better.","kalimat pembuka"],["**Body**","You should take a rest and drink warm water. We are waiting for you at school.","isi surat"],["**Closing**","Take care! / Best wishes, / Your friend,","penutup"],["**Name**","Rani","nama pengirim"]]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Contoh email","lines":[{"who":"Email","en":"Subject: Get well soon!","id":"Judul: Cepat sembuh!"},{"who":"Email","en":"Dear Budi,","id":"Budi yang baik,"},{"who":"Email","en":"I heard that you are sick. I hope you feel better soon. You should take a rest and drink a lot of water.","id":"Aku dengar kamu sakit. Semoga kamu lekas membaik. Sebaiknya kamu istirahat dan minum banyak air."},{"who":"Email","en":"Our class is waiting for you. We will send you the homework tomorrow.","id":"Kelas kita menunggumu. Kami akan mengirimkan PR besok."},{"who":"Email","en":"Take care! Your friend, Rani","id":"Jaga dirimu! Temanmu, Rani"}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Surat resmi atau tidak resmi?","text":"Untuk teman, pakai **Dear (nama)** dan penutup santai seperti **Take care** atau **Your friend**. Untuk orang yang lebih tua atau guru, boleh pakai **Dear Mr./Mrs./Miss (nama)** dan penutup **Best regards**."},{"t":"summary","items":["Keluhan: [[I have a headache.]] atau [[My head hurts.]]","Bertanya: [[What's the matter?]] / [[What's wrong?]]","Saran: [[You should ...]], [[You shouldn't ...]], [[Why don't you ...?]]","Penyemangat: [[Get well soon!]], [[Take care!]]","Surat/email: **Subject → Greeting → Opening → Body → Closing → Name**."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan keluhan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["headache","sakit kepala"],["toothache","sakit gigi"],["fever","demam"],["cough","batuk"],["sore throat","sakit tenggorokan"]],"exp":"Keluhan sakit sering dipakai sehari-hari."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian tubuh dengan artinya:","pairs":[["head","kepala"],["stomach","perut"],["throat","tenggorokan"],["shoulder","bahu"],["ear","telinga"]],"exp":"Bagian tubuh dipakai bersama hurts atau -ache."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Temanmu pucat. Kamu bertanya...","options":["What's the matter?","What's your name?","Where are you from?","How old are you?"],"answer":0,"exp":"What's the matter? = ada apa?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara menyatakan \"aku demam\" adalah...","options":["I have a fever.","I am a fever.","I has fever.","I fever."],"answer":0,"exp":"have a + keluhan."},{"type":"fill","id":"Perutku sakit.","q":"My stomach ___.","answers":["hurts"],"hint":"h _ _ _ _","exp":"My stomach hurts."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sakit gigi.","q":"She has a ___. (tooth + ache)","answers":["toothache"],"hint":"t _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"toothache = sakit gigi."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kamu sakit gigi. Saran yang tepat adalah...","options":["You should see a dentist.","You should eat more candy.","You should play football.","You must stay up late."],"answer":0,"exp":"dentist = dokter gigi."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Temanmu batuk. Saran yang baik adalah...","options":["You should drink warm water.","You should drink ice.","You should shout loudly.","You mustn't sleep."],"answer":0,"exp":"warm water membantu tenggorokan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Temanmu sakit perut. Kamu berkata...","options":["You shouldn't eat spicy food.","You should eat more chili.","You should run fast.","You must swim now."],"answer":0,"exp":"Saran: jangan makan pedas."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Ungkapan untuk menyemangati orang sakit adalah...","options":["Get well soon!","Good morning!","See you tomorrow!","Nice to meet you!"],"answer":0,"exp":"Get well soon = cepat sembuh."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sebaiknya kamu istirahat.\"","answer":"You should take a rest.","exp":"You + should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun pertanyaan: \"Ada apa?\"","answer":"What's the matter?","exp":"What's the matter?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian email \"Dear Budi,\" disebut...","options":["Closing","Greeting","Body","Subject"],"answer":1,"exp":"Dear ... = salam pembuka (greeting)."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Penutup surat untuk teman yang tepat adalah...","options":["Your friend,","Dear friend,","Subject:","What's wrong?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Closing = penutup."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa keluhannya?","say":"I have a headache and a sore throat","options":["Sakit kepala dan sakit tenggorokan","Sakit gigi dan demam","Batuk dan pilek","Sakit perut dan punggung"],"answer":0,"exp":"headache = sakit kepala; sore throat = sakit tenggorokan."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa sarannya?","say":"You should go to the doctor","options":["Sebaiknya pergi ke dokter","Sebaiknya pergi ke sekolah","Sebaiknya makan banyak","Sebaiknya bermain bola"],"answer":0,"exp":"doctor = dokter."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan bagian tubuh dengan artinya:","pairs":[["nose","hidung"],["mouth","mulut"],["neck","leher"],["arm","lengan"],["back","punggung"]],"exp":"Bagian tubuh."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan keluhan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["stomachache","sakit perut"],["backache","sakit punggung"],["cold","pilek"],["runny nose","hidung berair"],["sick","sakit"]],"exp":"Keluhan sakit."},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan ungkapan dengan artinya:","pairs":[["Get well soon!","Cepat sembuh!"],["Take care!","Jaga dirimu!"],["See a doctor.","Periksalah ke dokter."],["Take a rest.","Istirahatlah."]],"exp":"Ungkapan penyemangat dan saran."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has a fever.","She have a fever.","She is a fever.","She has fever a."],"answer":0,"exp":"She → has."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My head hurts.","My head hurt.","My head hurting.","My head is hurts."],"answer":0,"exp":"My head → hurts."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["You should drink a lot of water.","You should drinks a lot of water.","You should to drink a lot of water.","You shoulds drink a lot of water."],"answer":0,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih pertanyaan yang benar.","options":["What's the matter?","What the matter is?","What is matter the?","Whats matter?"],"answer":0,"exp":"What's the matter?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Keluhan: \"I have a sore throat.\" Saran yang baik adalah...","options":["You should drink warm tea.","You should shout loudly.","You mustn't drink water.","You may eat ice only."],"answer":0,"exp":"Teh hangat menenangkan tenggorokan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Keluhan: \"I have a toothache.\" Saran yang baik adalah...","options":["You should see a dentist.","You should eat sweet candy.","You should play football.","You mustn't brush your teeth."],"answer":0,"exp":"Dentist = dokter gigi."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Keluhan: \"I'm very tired.\" Saran yang baik adalah...","options":["Why don't you take a rest?","Why don't you run ten kilometers?","Why don't you stay up late?","Why don't you drink coffee all night?"],"answer":0,"exp":"Why don't you ...? = bagaimana kalau kamu ...?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian email \"Subject: Get well soon!\" adalah...","options":["Judul email","Salam pembuka","Penutup","Nama pengirim"],"answer":0,"exp":"Subject = judul."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kepalaku sakit.","q":"I have a ___. (head + ache)","answers":["headache"],"hint":"h _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"headache."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia batuk.","q":"He has a ___.","answers":["cough"],"hint":"c _ _ _ _","exp":"cough = batuk."},{"type":"fill","id":"Sebaiknya kamu istirahat.","q":"You ___ take a rest.","answers":["should"],"hint":"s _ _ _ _ _","exp":"should."},{"type":"fill","id":"Jaga dirimu!","q":"___ care!","answers":["take"],"hint":"t _ _ _","exp":"Take care!"},{"type":"fill","id":"Temanku, Rani.","q":"Dear Budi, ... ___ friend, Rani","answers":["your"],"hint":"y _ _ _","exp":"Your friend, Rani."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Perutku sakit.\"","answer":"My stomach hurts.","exp":"My stomach + hurts."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Aku harap kamu lekas membaik.\"","answer":"I hope you feel better soon.","exp":"I hope + you + feel better soon."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sebaiknya kamu pergi ke dokter.\"","answer":"You should go to the doctor.","exp":"You should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa keluhannya?","say":"I have a cough and a fever","options":["Batuk dan demam","Sakit kepala dan sakit gigi","Sakit perut dan pilek","Sakit punggung"],"answer":0,"exp":"cough = batuk; fever = demam."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa saran dokter?","say":"You should take a rest and drink a lot of water","options":["Istirahat dan banyak minum air","Berolahraga dan makan banyak","Tidur sedikit","Minum kopi"],"answer":0,"exp":"take a rest; drink a lot of water."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca email: \"Subject: Get well soon! Dear Budi, I heard that you have a fever. I hope you feel better soon. You should take a rest and drink warm water. Take care! Your friend, Rani\" Apa keluhan Budi?","options":["Demam","Batuk","Sakit gigi","Sakit perut"],"answer":0,"exp":"fever."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca email di atas. Apa saran Rani?","options":["Istirahat dan minum air hangat","Pergi ke sekolah","Bermain bola","Makan es krim"],"answer":0,"exp":"take a rest; warm water."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca: \"Dina has a toothache. She can't eat well. Her mother takes her to the dentist.\" Ke mana Dina dibawa?","options":["Dokter gigi","Rumah sakit anak","Apotek","Sekolah"],"answer":0,"exp":"dentist."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"What's the matter?\" B: \"___\"","options":["I have a stomachache.","I'm twelve.","I'm from Bali.","It's Monday."],"answer":0,"exp":"keluhan."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Baca dialog: A: \"I have a cough.\" B: \"___\"","options":["You should drink warm water.","You should eat ice cream.","You must run fast.","You may sleep outside."],"answer":0,"exp":"saran."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["She have a headache.","She has a headache.","I have a headache.","They have a headache."],"answer":0,"exp":"She → has."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["My head hurt.","My head hurts.","My legs hurt.","My stomach hurts."],"answer":0,"exp":"My head → hurts."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang SALAH?","options":["You should to see a doctor.","You should see a doctor.","You shouldn't eat spicy food.","You should rest."],"answer":0,"exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Aku sakit tenggorokan\" adalah...","options":["I have a sore throat.","I am a sore throat.","My throat sore am.","I has sore throat."],"answer":0,"exp":"I have a sore throat."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Terjemahan \"Semoga kamu lekas sembuh\" adalah...","options":["I hope you get well soon.","I hope you are sick soon.","I hope you will get a doctor.","Hope you well sick."],"answer":0,"exp":"get well soon."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang tidak sama kelompoknya adalah...","options":["throat","fever","cough","cold"],"answer":0,"exp":"throat = bagian tubuh."},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia sakit gigi.","q":"She has a ___.","answers":["toothache"],"hint":"t _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _","exp":"toothache."},{"type":"fill","id":"Kepalaku sakit.","q":"My head ___.","answers":["hurts"],"hint":"h _ _ _ _","exp":"hurts."},{"type":"fill","id":"Aku merasa tidak enak badan.","q":"I ___ sick.","answers":["feel"],"hint":"f _ _ _","exp":"feel."},{"type":"fill","id":"Istirahatlah.","q":"Take a ___.","answers":["rest"],"hint":"r _ _ _","exp":"rest."},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sebaiknya kamu minum banyak air.\"","answer":"You should drink a lot of water.","exp":"should + kata kerja dasar."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa keluhannya?","say":"I have a runny nose and a cough","options":["Hidung berair dan batuk","Sakit perut dan demam","Sakit kepala dan gigi","Sakit punggung"],"answer":0,"exp":"runny nose; cough."},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa pesannya?","say":"Get well soon and take care","options":["Cepat sembuh dan jaga dirimu","Datang ke sekolah","Belajar yang rajin","Selamat tinggal"],"answer":0,"exp":"Get well soon; take care."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Temanmu terlihat pucat. Apa yang kamu tanyakan?","options":["What's the matter? You look pale.","Who are you? You look pale.","Where are you? You look pale.","When are you? You look pale."],"answer":0,"exp":"What's the matter?"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Situasi: Temanmu bilang, \"I have a toothache.\" Apa saranmu?","options":["You should see a dentist.","You should eat candy.","You must play football.","You mustn't sleep."],"answer":0,"exp":"dentist."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["headache","headake","hedache","headech"],"answer":0,"exp":"headache."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["stomach","stomack","stomuch","stommach"],"answer":0,"exp":"stomach."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana ejaan yang benar?","options":["medicine","medicin","medicene","medisine"],"answer":0,"exp":"medicine."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ is the matter?\"","options":["What","Who","Where","When"],"answer":0,"exp":"What's the matter."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ long have you had a cough?\" (Dua hari.)","options":["How","Who","Where","What time"],"answer":0,"exp":"How long."},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kata tanya yang tepat: \"___ do you feel?\" (Pusing.)","options":["How","Who","Where is","When is"],"